    "listingDescription": "Delve into the heart of Georgia's rich heritage on this 5-day tour, blending historic landmarks, breathtaking landscapes, and the country's celebrated hospitality.",
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival and city tour in Tbilisi",
        "content": "<p>Begin your Georgian adventure with arrival in Tbilisi and immerse yourself in the capital's charm. Explore the atmospheric Old Town with its narrow cobblestone streets, visit the ancient Narikala Fortress overlooking the city, and discover the iconic Peace Bridge. Relax in Tbilisi's famous sulfur baths, a tradition dating back centuries, and experience the vibrant blend of modernity and historical heritage that defines this captivating city.</p><ul><li>Arrival in Tbilisi and hotel check-in;</li><li>Explore Tbilisi Old Town;</li><li>Visit Narikala Fortress;</li><li>Walk across the Peace Bridge;</li><li>Relax in historic sulfur baths;</li><li>Overnight stay in Tbilisi.</li><li><strong>Duration of the tour:</strong> 4-5 hours</li><li><strong>Driving duration:</strong> 30 minutes</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Tbilisi – Jvari – Mtskheta – Ananuri – Stepantsminda (Kazbegi)",
        "content": "<p>Journey along the famous Georgian Military Highway towards the mountains. Visit the UNESCO World Heritage sites of Jvari Monastery and Svetitskhoveli Cathedral in Mtskheta, Georgia's spiritual heart. Stop at the picturesque Ananuri Fortress beside the stunning Jinvali Reservoir, then continue to Stepantsminda (Kazbegi), a serene mountain town at the foot of Mount Kazbek, surrounded by breathtaking Caucasus peaks.</p><ul><li>Visit Jvari Monastery (UNESCO World Heritage Site);</li><li>Explore Mtskheta and Svetitskhoveli Cathedral;</li><li>Stop at Ananuri Architectural Complex;</li><li>Enjoy views of Jinvali Reservoir;</li><li>Arrive in Stepantsminda (Kazbegi);</li><li>Overnight stay in Kazbegi.</li><li><strong>Duration of the tour:</strong> 8-9 hours</li><li><strong>Driving duration:</strong> 3.5 hours</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Kazbegi – Tsinandali – Telavi",
        "content": "<p>Start your day with a visit to the iconic Gergeti Trinity Church, offering awe-inspiring panoramic views of the Caucasus Mountains and Mount Kazbek. Then journey to Georgia's wine country, beginning with the historic Tsinandali Estate known for its beautiful gardens and insights into Georgian winemaking traditions. Continue to Telavi, the hub of the Kakheti wine region, where you'll enjoy local cuisine and explore the rich winemaking heritage.</p><ul><li>Visit Gergeti Trinity Church with mountain views;</li><li>Depart Kazbegi for wine country;</li><li>Explore Tsinandali Estate and gardens;</li><li>Wine tasting experience;</li><li>Arrive in Telavi;</li><li>Overnight stay in Telavi.</li><li><strong>Duration of the tour:</strong> 8-9 hours</li><li><strong>Driving duration:</strong> 4 hours</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: Telavi – Khareba Winery – Sighnaghi – Bodbe – Tbilisi",
        "content": "<p>Experience the best of Kakheti wine region today. Visit the unique Khareba Winery, famous for its wine cellar built into natural caves, and enjoy wine tasting in this extraordinary setting. Continue to Sighnaghi, the charming \"City of Love\" with cobblestone streets and stunning views of the Alazani Valley. Visit the peaceful Bodbe Monastery with its deep religious significance, before returning to Tbilisi for your final evening.</p><ul><li>Visit Khareba Winery (cave wine cellar);</li><li>Wine tasting experience;</li><li>Explore Sighnaghi, the \"City of Love\";</li><li>Visit Bodbe Monastery;</li><li>Scenic drive back to Tbilisi;</li><li>Overnight stay in Tbilisi.</li><li><strong>Duration of the tour:</strong> 9-10 hours</li><li><strong>Driving duration:</strong> 3.5 hours</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 5: Departure from Tbilisi",
        "content": "<p>Enjoy your final morning in Tbilisi with free time to explore any remaining sights, do some last-minute shopping, or simply relax and reflect on your Georgian adventure. Check out from your hotel and transfer to Tbilisi International Airport for your departure, taking with you unforgettable memories of Georgia's rich heritage, stunning landscapes, and warm hospitality.</p><ul><li>Final morning in Tbilisi;</li><li>Free time for last-minute exploration;</li><li>Hotel check-out;</li><li>Transfer to Tbilisi International Airport;</li><li>Departure from Georgia.</li><li><strong>Duration:</strong> As per flight schedule</li></ul>"
      }
    ],
